# Build context hygiene for the Node images (Dockerfile.node, context = repo root).
# Keep host-built artifacts and secrets OUT of the image — deps are installed
# fresh inside the container (avoids macOS→Linux native-binary mismatches), and
# env is injected by docker-compose (env_file + environment), not baked in.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__
**/*.egg-info
**/.venv
**/venv
**/env
.git
.gitignore
*.md
docs
research
infra/n8n/.n8n
services/data/bt_out
services/data/wf_out
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
